 The ASCII glyph table is the generic 5x7 character-LCD font that has been
 reproduced for decades in display example code without an author or a
 copyright notice; its original source is not known. It is treated here as
 public domain. The degree sign and the code around the table are part of
 this project and under Apache-2.0.
